<title>USA: K-III's Westcott acquires QWIZ Inc.</title>
<headline>K-III's Westcott acquires QWIZ Inc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>K-III Communications Corp's Westcott said on Monday that it has acquired QWIZ Inc, a leading provider of PC-based skills testing sold to temporary agencies and corporate clients.</p>
<p>QWIZ, headquartered in Atlanta with an operation in London, has approximately 70 employees.  Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
